dpkg-reconfigure-noninteractive(8) -- wrapper to run `dpkg-reconfigure` non-interactively
=============================================

<!--
# Copyright (C) 2026 - 2026 ENCRYPTED SUPPORT LLC <adrelanos@whonix.org>
# See the file COPYING for copying conditions.
-->

## SYNOPSIS
`dpkg-reconfigure-noninteractive` [args...]

## DESCRIPTION
Simple wrapper that sets environment variables for non-interactive use,
prevents daemons from restarting during reconfiguration, then forwards
all arguments to `dpkg-reconfigure`. No debconf prompts will appear
during reconfiguration.

## EXAMPLES
`sudo dpkg-reconfigure-noninteractive tzdata`

`sudo dpkg-reconfigure-noninteractive keyboard-configuration`

